---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Airborne Dent Repair"
  description="What Airborne Dent Repair collects through this website, why, who it goes to, and how to have it deleted."
  nav="Privacy" css="retail">
<main>

<section class="hero hero-short" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">Privacy Policy.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">What this site collects, why, who it reaches, and how to have it removed. Short, because there is not much of it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap legal-doc">
    <p class="w3f-hint rv"><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026 &middot; Airborne Dent Repair, 489 Reed Ln, Unit 2, Gunter, TX 75058</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Only what you type into a form on this site, and only on the three pages that have one.</p>
    <p class="prose rv"><strong>The estimate form on our contact page:</strong> your name, phone number, email address if you give one, the year, make and model of your vehicle, the type of damage, whether an insurance claim is involved, your insurance carrier if you tell us, and whatever you write in the message box.</p>
    <p class="prose rv"><strong>The wholesale and claims form:</strong> your business name, contact name, phone number, email address if you give one, business type, approximate monthly volume, which services you need, and whatever you write in the message box.</p>
    <p class="prose rv"><strong>The pre-arrival check-in form:</strong> your name, address, city, state and ZIP, email address, cell and work phone numbers, how you heard about us, whether you need a rental car, your vehicle&rsquo;s year, make, model, color and mileage, and &mdash; only if a claim is involved &mdash; your insurance company, claim number, deductible amount, whether a previous initial estimate exists and for how much, and your adjuster&rsquo;s name, phone number, email address and fax number.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">What we deliberately do not collect</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">There are things this website will never ask you for, on any page or any form:</p>
    <p class="prose rv"><strong>Driver&rsquo;s licence numbers. Dates of birth. Vehicle identification numbers (VINs). Licence plate numbers. Insurance policy numbers. Card numbers, card expiry dates or security codes. Signatures.</strong></p>
    <p class="prose rv">Those belong on paper, and they are taken at the shop with a person in front of you when you sign the repair authorization. If a page on this site ever asks you for one of them, it is not ours &mdash; close it and call us on <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a>.</p>
    <p class="prose rv">We also do not ask for anything about your health, and we take no payment on this website.</p>
    <p class="prose rv">None of the three forms accepts file or photo uploads. If we ask you for photographs, we ask you to email them.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Where it goes</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">A form submission is passed to <a href="https://web3forms.com/">Web3Forms</a>, a third-party service that turns it into an email and delivers it to the shop. Estimate requests and pre-arrival check-ins go to <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a>. Wholesale and claims inquiries go to <a href="mailto:Claimsairbornedentrepair@gmail.com">Claimsairbornedentrepair@gmail.com</a>. Both are Gmail accounts, so Google handles the mail once it arrives.</p>
    <p class="prose rv">This website has no database. Nothing you submit is stored on it. The copy in our inbox is the only copy we keep.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">What we use it for</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">To reply to you, quote the work, carry out the work, and — if you have told us a claim is involved — to deal with your insurer about your vehicle. That is the whole list.</p>
    <p class="prose rv"><strong>We do not sell your information, rent it, trade it, or share it for anyone else's marketing.</strong> We do not add you to a mailing list. We will not contact you about anything other than the job you contacted us about.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Third parties this site touches</h2>
    <p class="prose rv"><strong>Web3Forms</strong> processes form submissions and emails them to us. Your submission passes through their systems.</p>
    <p class="prose rv"><strong>hCaptcha</strong> runs on all three forms to keep spam out. It is provided by Intuition Machines and it collects information about your device and how you interact with the challenge in order to decide whether you are a person. It loads only on the three pages that have a form.</p>
    <p class="prose rv"><strong>Vercel</strong> hosts this site and keeps standard server logs, including IP addresses, as part of serving pages and defending against abuse. We have not added Google Analytics or any other tracking or advertising service, and there are no advertising cookies on this site.</p>
    <p class="prose rv">Fonts and images are served from this site itself, not from a third-party CDN, so simply reading a page here does not hand your visit to anyone else.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Your message sits in the shop inbox. We keep enquiries and job correspondence for as long as we may need them for the work, for warranty claims — paintless repairs carry a lifetime warranty, so that can be a long time — and for our tax and business records. If you ask us to delete something and we are not required to keep it, we will.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Asking us to delete it</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Email <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a> and tell us what you want removed. We will confirm when it is done. You can also ask us what we hold about you and we will tell you.</p>
    <p class="prose rv">If you are a Texas resident, this is how to exercise those rights with us &mdash; there is no form to fill in and no charge.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Children</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">This site is for people arranging vehicle repair. It is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 13.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Changes</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">If we change what we collect or who it goes to, we will change this page and update the date at the top.</p>

    <h2 class="display h-sm rv">Contact</h2>
    <p class="prose rv">Airborne Dent Repair &middot; 489 Reed Ln, Unit 2, Gunter, TX 75058<br />
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a> &middot; <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a></p>

    <p class="prose rv" style="margin-top:2rem"><a href="/terms">Terms of use &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
</Base>
